      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Two toddler bucket swings hang from a teal palm-tree post on the Toddler Swing. Bucket seats wrap around a small child's legs and back, so they sit securely while an adult pushes. It is meant for the 2 to 4 years Key User Group and seats two. The palm-tree design gives a nursery, play school or toddler corner a playful look. The frame takes up 8'8\" x 3'6\" and needs a safe play area of 10'8\" x 12'1\". Its colour is Horizon Teal. Our 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipe and roto-moulded parts, and bearings and spare parts are covered for 1 year. Share your site photos and we will show it on a layout drawing."
